        "number": 1,
        "text": "4 tbsp. butter - Cream with yolks of 2 eggs. Add 2 cups granulated sugar. Add 2¼ cups Swansdown flour in which has been placed ½ tsp. salt and 3 tsp. baking powder. Add flour alternately with 1½ cups whole milk. Then add 4 squares melted chocolate, 1 tsp. vanilla, 1 cup nuts and stiffly beaten whites of 2 eggs. Dear Grandmother:— This is a long promised recipe finally coming. Emily Frances",
